#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libmusicbrainz"
msgstr "Instalação do libmusicbrainz"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libmusicbrainz</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libmusicbrainz</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:107
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../libmusicbrainz-&libmusicbrainz-version;-missing-includes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"CXXFLAGS=\"${CXXFLAGS:--O2 -g} -std=c++98\" \\\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../libmusicbrainz-&libmusicbrainz-version;-missing-includes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"CXXFLAGS=\"${CXXFLAGS:--O2 -g} -std=c++98\" \\\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>Python</application> is installed, build the bindings with "
"the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Se o <application>Python</application> estiver instalado, construa as "
"ligações com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>(cd python &amp;&amp; python2 setup.py build)</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>(cd python &amp;&amp; python2 setup.py build)</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package does not come with a stand-alone test suite (to test you must "
"have <application>Python</application> installed and perform the test after "
"the package is installed)."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste independente (para testar você "
"precisa ter o <application>Python</application> instalado e realizar o teste"
" depois que o pacote estiver instalado)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:130
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 -D docs/mb_howto.txt \\\n"
"    /usr/share/doc/libmusicbrainz-&libmusicbrainz-version;/mb_howto.txt</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 -D docs/mb_howto.txt \\\n"
"    /usr/share/doc/libmusicbrainz-&libmusicbrainz-version;/mb_howto.txt</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the Python bindings, issue the following: <command>(cd python "
"&amp;&amp; python2 setup.py test)</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar as ligações do Python, emita o seguinte: <command>(cd python "
"&amp;&amp; python2 setup.py test)</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built the Python bindings, issue the following commands as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to install them:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu as ligações Python, emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> para instalá-"
"las:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libmusicbrainz.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>(cd python &amp;&amp; python2 setup.py install)</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>(cd python &amp;&amp; python2 setup.py install)</userinput>"

